<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/00663091b426> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[208] On Thursday morning, a Waze spokesperson told Mashable that the Google-owned company had worked with the Los Angeles Department of Transportation (LADOT) to close around 110 dangerous road segments on the app." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "208" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/006b3dd716c0> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[199] The Google-developed Waze app, uses information from users about traffic, road hazards, construction and other route obstructions, and relies heavily on real time reports and frequently updated data." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "199" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/00cd2ce6b49a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Users of popular navigation apps like Waze are warning the services directed them to neighborhoods where wildfires forced closures and evacuations." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "200" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/01e153c060b5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Waze and Google Maps are consistently ranked among the top navigation apps on Apple's App Store." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "206" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/026e91aea7eb> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Users of popular navigation apps like Waze are warning the services directed them to neighborhoods where wildfires forced closures and evacuations." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "196" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/034db73bdacd> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Representatives from the Los Angeles Department of Transportation said information about road closures filters through several verification checks starting from field officers on the ground before it is reported to Waze." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "205" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/08220c4b33c4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Waze, Google Maps Send California Residents Straight Into Wildfires" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "199" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/08be61e5d01d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Largely reliant on information supplied by other drivers, when the Google-owned app notices gridlock on a user's route, it will reroute the driver to quieter streets." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "206" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0c1e8d724f22> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[203] The city has a data sharing agreement with Waze, and Krekorian introduced a motion that would direct the city's Department of Transportation to report to the City Council on the current partnership with Waze and other app operators." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "203" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/153b65a3acb6> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[199] The Google-developed Waze app, uses information from users about traffic, road hazards, construction and other route obstructions, and relies heavily on real time reports and frequently updated data." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "199" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1e0bc3ae324e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[200] Google maps, waze, and apple maps all seem to think I can take the 405 to work and drive right through the fire without any problems." ;
